Z||000000||Scott||07-25-2001||01:17 AM||||I just opened a box containing a really f'up order from the Fiero Store.  I ordered a few things including a steel clutch pedal and a front GT emblem.  I got all my stuff except the steel pedal and I got a coupe front facia emblem!  The box is 1 of 1, and the invoice says everything was sent, but I don't have the steel pedal.  What gives!  Has anyone else had a problem with them?<BR>  This really sucks, I'm leaving on road trip tomorrow, and wanted to have the clutch pedal installed by noon.  I even had it sent w/ 2 day shipping to be sure I got it on time.  Somebody over there is gonna get an earful tomorrow morning.<BR>Scott||||reg||1
Z||000001||87GTBro||07-25-2001||01:30 AM||||my brother had a problem with them shipping the wrong stuff, but I personally have not.<P>But when they did it to him, they did send that clutch pedal (without charging for it) and forgot to send a much cheaper item.  So we came out on top.  Why argue.<P>Other than that.... all good... so far...||||reg||1
Z||000002||DecadenceR||07-25-2001||01:53 AM||||I had a problem with spring seats. but i called them up and they sent me the correct ones. Just sucks that you have to wait to do the pedal now||||reg||1
