Z||000020||artherd||07-27-2001||02:20 AM||||Well, I finally put on the "blue" headlights from the fierostore.  Spent about two hours yanking everything out of there and putting it all back together (grr)<P>So I fire them up, and they're gold not blue.  OK, I can get the blue bulbs and just stick them in the back because the non-sealed idea is better....<P>So it's 7pm and I decide to take a little drive (20min through the hills, CA rocks)<P>Then they go out.  Then I switch to the high beams, AND THEY GO OUT TOO.<P>After driving home with only the fricking emergency blinkers, I discover that BOTH BULBS HAVE EXPLODED!!!!!!!!!!!!<BR>And got flame/etc all over the inside of the lense/glass so that means another 2hrs of work for me. <P>[Explative deleted, several times]<P>SO now I'm genuinely pissed, and a little puzzled. Did vacumm/halogen gas somehow leak out of these puppies? BOTH of them?<P>(No, I'm not a dubmass, I didn't touch the bulbs, ever, with my slimy fingers :P)<P>Now I get to see if the Fiero Store will honor any kind fo warranty, as the parts have been sitting on a shelf for ~6months :(<P>All that said, they've been great for everything else I've bought, and I've purchased from them many many times. In particuliar their carbonmet pads and drilled rotors are pretty nifty as a stopgap untill the willwoods are here. and not too expensive even!<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000021||AkursedX||07-27-2001||02:42 AM||||Well I just recently got the wrong lifters and I called and got them sent back the next day.  Personally, I love the Fierostore and I have purchased from them many times, and even after this mixup, I will still buy from them with confidence.  Their customer service is top notch  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
